# Optional since "Where is the butler?" (2026-09-04). The app asks for the
# address and the token on first start and keeps them in the phone's
# encrypted store, so this file is no longer the only source and no longer
# required: an APK built without it carries no token at all, which is what
# makes one build installable on another phone against another butler.
#
# Copy to butler.properties (gitignored) and fill in to prefill the setup
# screen on a development build. The URL may be typed without a scheme —
# the app assumes http, since the NAS is plain HTTP on the tailnet.
url=http://192.168.1.42:9380
token=changeme
